From 7d7de432270d10688590949b02a8931679b62dab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RivonClaw CI <ci@rivonclaw.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 00:52:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] vendor(openclaw): expose silent completion for agent RPC

Why:
- Trusted internal RPC callers need clean empty model completions to settle as intentional silent replies.

Removal:
- Drop when upstream AgentParamsSchema and gateway execution expose allowEmptyAssistantReplyAsSilent without overriding subagent handoff behavior.

Tests:
- apps/desktop/src/cs-bridge/vendor-agent-silent-completion.sentinel.test.ts
